<title>USA: School Dist #1, Minn., $47 mln won by Interstate.</title>
<headline>School Dist #1, Minn., $47 mln won by Interstate.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Interstate/Johnson Lane Corp said it won $47 million of Special School District No. 1, Minn., general obligation school building bonds of 1996, with a true interest cost of 5.149 percent.</p>
</text>
